Suppose that I see a fellow who I particularly dislike. Lets say that
I manage to get a law passed in the legislature declaring the death penalty
for drunk driving, and then frame him for the offense. I can get him
killed. Far fetched? El Salvador, five years ago.

Suppose that I see a guy who I don't like, and I anonymously denounce him
